    <string name="maint_plan_125">📖 Zontes scooter service plan</string>
    <string name="maint_plan_125_msg">Replaces the tasks with the Zontes small-scooter plan (from the 125X manual — check the intervals in your Z150X service booklet): first service at 1,000 km, the second at 6,000 and then every 6,000 (or 15 months), plus oil filter, gearbox oil, valves, belt, pulley bushings, steering lock, spark plug, brake fluid and coolant on their own cycles.\n\nWhat you have already logged and your own tasks are kept.\n\nRiding in humidity or dust? The manual says to shorten the intervals.</string>
